# Reference illustration — per-tenant secrets for `acme/widget`.
#
# Read ONLY by this tenant's engine child: the supervisor builds each child's env
# deny-by-default from an allowlist plus THIS file, so no other tenant's secrets —
# and not the deployment-root GH_TOKEN — are ever visible here (#61).
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; never commit it.

# --- Required: this tenant authenticates every `gh`/git call with its own token ---
GH_TOKEN=

# --- Provider key: this tenant's defaultProvider is `claude` ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
